Description:
    Provides a framework for modeling cellular metabolic states and continuous 
    metabolic trajectories from single-cell RNA-seq data using pathway-level 
    scoring. Enables lineage-restricted metabolic analysis, metabolic 
    'pseudotime' inference, module-level trend analysis, and visualization of 
    metabolic state transitions.
